From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:04:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 092/159] [ae-patch] Show a permanent context answer at once
 instead of retrying it

An unavailable context answer that retrying can never fix now carries final: true: a session whose runner reports another harness, and a host without the Linux /proc interface. The web treats a final answer as settled, shows its reason at once with no Try again and schedules no quiet retry. A session whose harness the runner does not know yet answers pending, since its spec has not loaded. Answers without final keep the earlier rules.
